<section class="vc-workflow-intro compact single-task" aria-labelledby="payout-bank-title"><div class="vc-workflow-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"></i></div><div><span class="vc-section-kicker">PAYOUT SETUP</span><h2 id="payout-bank-title">Where your approved payouts are sent</h2><p>Enter the account exactly as shown in your bank records and upload matching proof for admin verification.</p></div></section>
<section class="vc-page-actions"><div><span class="vc-status info" id="vpb-status">Loading payout account…</span></div></section>
<section class="vc-card vc-focused-form"><div class="vc-card-head"><div><h2>Current payout account</h2><span class="vc-help">Only the final four digits are displayed</span></div></div><div class="vc-card-body" id="vpb-banks">Loading…</div></section>
<section class="vc-card vc-focused-form mt-3"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Add or replace payout bank details</h2></div><form class="vc-card-body" id="vpb-bank-form" novalidate><p class="vc-help">Submitting new details makes them the primary payout account and sends them for review.</p><div class="vc-form-grid"><div class="vc-field"><label for="vpb-beneficiary">Account holder name</label><input class="vc-input" id="vpb-beneficiary" name="beneficiary" required minlength="2" maxlength="150" autocomplete="name" placeholder="e.g., Raju Kumar"><small class="vc-help">Must match the name shown on the bank proof.</small></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="vpb-ifsc">IFSC</label><input class="vc-input" id="vpb-ifsc" name="ifsc" required maxlength="11" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g., SBIN0001234"><small class="vc-help">Find the 11-character IFSC on your cheque, passbook or bank app.</small></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="vpb-account-number">Account number</label><input class="vc-input" id="vpb-account-number" name="account_number" required minlength="8" maxlength="18" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter 8–18 digit account number"></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="vpb-account-confirm">Confirm account number</label><input class="vc-input" id="vpb-account-confirm" name="account_confirm" required minlength="8" maxlength="18" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter the same account number again"></div><div class="vc-field full"><label for="vpb-bank-proof">Cancelled cheque or bank proof</label><input class="vc-input" id="vpb-bank-proof" name="bank_proof" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,application/pdf" required><small class="vc-help">Upload a clear JPG, PNG or PDF under 5 MB showing the holder name, account number and IFSC.</small></div></div><div class="vc-form-actions"><span class="vc-save-confirmation" data-save-confirmation role="status" hidden></span><button class="vc-btn primary" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Submit bank details</button></div></form></section>
